  "analyses": [
    "* issue #165 convergence study (final form): two-tone + one-tone reads of the",
    "* TRACKED 1037.5 MHz bin at the top-of-fit drive 0.056 V across sample-count",
    "* rungs (endpoint-aligned windows, tstop = 20n + (N-1)*tstep: the issue-#135",
    "* construction, so the saved grid is exactly N uniform samples and the fft is",
    "* coherent with zero padding). pfund_dbm is the coherence canary: any rung",
    "* whose saved stream stopped being the uniform grid (reltol tightened past the",
    "* tstep-clamp boundary) shows pfund moving off -31.79 dBm and its cells are",
    "* invalid. SCRATCH study -- not evidence: --no-write runs only.",
    "set drv_pin=0",
    "alterparam vrf = 0.056",
    "alterparam vrf2 = 0.056",
    "reset",
    "tran 9.765625p 99.990234375n 20n",
    "fft v(coll) v(prf)",
    "let bin_hz = frequency[1] - frequency[0]",
    "let vim3hi = mag(v(coll))[floor((1037.5e6)/bin_hz + 0.5)]",
    "let vif1 = mag(v(coll))[floor((987.5e6)/bin_hz + 0.5)]",
    "let pim3 = 10*log10((vim3hi*vim3hi)/(2*50*1e-3))",
    "let pfund = 10*log10((vif1*vif1)/(2*50*1e-3))",
    "echo \"CONV2T n=8192 pim3_dbm=$&pim3 pfund_dbm=$&pfund bin_hz=$&bin_hz\"",
